      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Considering the situation, it's probably a good idea to take a break and rest for a few minutes to see if your dizziness passes. You can try closing your eyes or sitting in a quiet area to reduce any stress on your eyes from the bright light. If the dizziness persists, you can also take a few deep breaths, inhaling through both nostrils and exhaling slowly to help calm yourself down. This may help alleviate the symptoms and allow you to focus on work.",
